  "modifier.avaritia_integration.blaze_crown.flavor": "Beheads skeletons and scorches them black",
  "modifier.avaritia_integration.blaze_crown.description": "Greatly extends target's burning duration; Automatically smelts dropped items; Drops Wither Skeleton Skulls when killing any Skeleton type",

